Dear {!Contact.FirstName} {!Contact.LastName},<br /><br />

Thank you for your email to the ASU Graduate Format Office. This is an automated email to acknowledge that your email has been received and to let you know that a personal response will occur in the order in which your email was received. If you are seeking format review, please expect a response within 3-5 business days.<br /><br />

IMPORTANT: If you are a student planning to graduate in the current semester, please visit our website for important graduation deadlines:<br /> https://graduate.asu.edu/index.php?q=completing-your-degree.<br /><br /> 

